  "scope": "Both shared ImGui hosts pool scientific C/T/Z histogram grids and positioned area ROI unions through the qualified native target service.",
  "behavior": "Target... exposes Current/All/First/Last/Step and whole/active/positioned area policies. Current uses the opening pose, independently of simple-plane drafts/live navigation. Invalid or unfinished range drafts disable Calculate but preserve the last successful result and raw export. The modeless target window closes without computing. Source data/history are untouched. Overlaps count once and unmatched planes contribute no samples.",
  "result_scope": "Pooled result labels, plane count, sampled ranges, ROI policy, provenance and admitted target counts remain frozen with the calculated data. Switching back to basic mode restores its drafts without replacing a pooled result. Single-plane fields cannot override the scientific grid/ROI. Native raw/custom binning, finite-ROI statistics, log1p heights and shared lossless CSV remain. Source closure releases the capture and preserves detached export until panel close.",
  "api": "configure_histogram_target accepts only a strict target object, validates metadata-only Current/AllZ/Ranges plane grids and atomically replaces the draft. It rejects explicit position lists, volume mode and new-document destinations for this panel. configure_histogram adds a strict Boolean scientific flag; inactive basic fields are ignored by scientific calculation. Calculation retains source/revision/read/resource guards.",
  "shared_widgets": "OperationTargetPanel gains defaulted heading/description/positioned-hint text so analysis controls describe pooling and zero-membership planes. Existing edit-panel defaults retain their original text and behavior. Existing scientific threshold actual-input checks are requalified.",
  "verification": "916 selected checks per OS, including 51 new checks (18 shared UI/33 controller API). Independent literal/formula readers verify 144 reports / 24780 input frames, including 36 new reports / 7848 frames, across both platforms/launchers. Counts/edges/statistics/log heights/CSV bytes, range errors, frozen result labels, mode isolation, unmatched ROIs, source invalidation, navigation and data/history/recording preservation are checked. Four native executable suites per OS and fresh installed SDK consumers pass. No new Java oracle or real GPU/full-platform certification is claimed.",
